[Google Photos official website](https://www.google.com/intl/en_gb/photos/about/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

Google Photos is arguably the strongest direct competitor.

Its capabilities include:
- Automatic backup.
- Search by objects, people and places.
- Location-based organisation.
- Albums and sharing.
- AI-powered image search.
- AI-assisted memory discovery.

Its Ask Photos functionality uses Gemini to support conversational searches and questions about photographs. Google explicitly acknowledges that the experimental functionality can return unexpected or inaccurate results. Availability also varies by region. [Google Help](https://support.google.com/photos/answer/15318661?hl=en-GB\&utm_source=chatgpt.com)

**Our implication:** Natural-language photo search cannot be our main differentiator. Google already offers it.

