[Apple Photos and iCloud+](https://www.apple.com/uk/icloud/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

Apple offers an integrated photo experience for its ecosystem.

Its strengths include:
- Automatic synchronisation.
- People and pet collections.
- Location-based organisation.
- Memories and curated collections.
- Search and image editing.
- Family storage sharing.

Its UK iCloud+ pricing currently starts at £0.99 per month for 50GB, £2.99 for 200GB and £8.99 for 2TB. [Apple](https://www.apple.com/uk/icloud/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

**Our implication:** Cross-device and cross-ecosystem importation could be a useful differentiator, particularly for users who have accumulated photographs over many years using different devices.

